# Docs language and tradeoff log

Project documents go in English. This includes new or edited files under `Docs/`, README files, and other markdown written for the project. Chat with the user can follow the user's language. Do not translate existing Chinese docs unless the user asks.

When a task chooses among alternatives — a feature definition, join key, distance formula, model setup, validation split, or anything else with a rejected option — append one entry to `Docs/design_tradeoffs.md` before finishing. Add it under "Log of later tradeoffs". Do not leave the decision only in chat.

Each entry states the options, the evidence checked, the decision, what a later report may say, and what it must not say. If the choice was not tested against `MONTHLY_RENT`, say that in the entry.
